{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610780/extras/398c704ab5e7debf4cb7c3dc3d8c7f31.webp?t=1760487025\" width=616 height=54 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is an interactive adaptation of <i>El gaucho Mart\u00edn Fierro</i>. Through various minigames, the player will discover the story of the legendary gaucho, narrated in verses taken directly from the original work. Each level offers a different mechanic, from rhythm challenges and skill-based tests to duels and puzzles, reflecting different moments of Fierro's journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610780/extras/76d987e94b8d536dbae75366ae0c75f9.webp?t=1760487025\" width=616 height=54 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is designed to be accessible to all types of players. The mechanics are simple and easy to learn, allowing anyone to immerse themselves in the story without difficulty barriers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610780/extras/aae69bd11ec8b8c0a362315964dc5196.webp?t=1760487025\" width=616 height=54 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The visual style aims to convey the simplicity, and even the harshness, of life in the Argentine pampas in the mid-19th century. With an aesthetic inspired by literature and gaucho folklore, the graphics evoke the feeling of being inside the pages of a book.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610780/extras/6764c810c1c4dda825d989c46fd180ed.webp?t=1760487025\" width=616 height=54 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story of <i>Mart\u00edn Fierro</i> is filled with tragedy, injustice, and struggle, but also with wisdom and reflection. As the game progresses, the verses narrate the life of the wandering gaucho, his confrontations with authority, his losses, and his quest for freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610780/extras/07587762eb176b4adafae4763eca03a2.webp?t=1760487025\" width=616 height=54 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game can be completed in about 1 hour. More than an extensive challenge, it is a short experience designed as a gateway to the story of <i>Mart\u00edn Fierro</i>. If it sparks your curiosity about the original work, then it has fulfilled its purpose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610780/extras/4273afe099dcf97f999e1df60920f5ce.webp?t=1760487025\" width=616 height=54 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All the verses in the game are taken directly from the original work. Although, for obvious reasons, a large part of the text has been omitted, the essence of the story remains intact. This game is not only a tribute to <i>Mart\u00edn Fierro</i> but also a way to bring its legacy to new generations through interactivity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Glory to the Singer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3610780/60b07fe171cad56e3ff3240d0751ae8a83d092a1.jpg"},{"name":"Like a Feather in a Gale","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3610780/a10726fe28531faaef786d2af70fb1f9981e65c7.jpg"},{"name":"The Footprint","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3610780/68c5a5f16652d1bc61a126c4b851cc6cb35b3454.jpg"},{"name":"Cat on a Hot Tin Roof","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3610780/79eb32a41b7feabffba2bc61fc20a6f64c35b0d4.jpg"},{"name":"Glutton","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3610780/c5adc295654d8ef05a60fff934466ea2be0c668d.jpg"},{"name":"Master of the Dagger","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3610780/1ab934405085e1443b20f123f5f0a92632b3a0d4.jpg"},{"name":"Survival","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3610780/ec285320da50b52bd14a9f504cf680fbe420dd03.jpg"},{"name":"The Southern Cross","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3610780/f0fb9175b2f6bf1b9455494d55c5fe1be617fe73.jpg"},{"name":"True Strike","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3610780/f535532f16a2bf7f07c640389cf7c0ffa54075f7.jpg"},{"name":"Silence on the Plain","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3610780/927dde05913e88471887175a2472e28332eeefbf.jpg"}],"total":10},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3610780?t=1760487025","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610780/82b8c0e6fd7ebc6e0f003c6c3001a7747a077106/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760487025","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610780/3d0b4c961601b8dbef96fada21aff4be7516ffb5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760487025","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610780/3d0b4c961601b8dbef96fada21aff4be7516ffb5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760487025","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2