 life in the Argentine pampas in the mid-19th century. With an aesthetic inspired by literature and gaucho folklore, the graphics evoke the feeling of being inside the pages of a book.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610780/extras/6764c810c1c4dda825d989c46fd180ed.webp?t=1760487025\" width=616 height=54 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story of <i>Mart\u00edn Fierro</i> is filled with tragedy, injustice, and struggle, but also with wisdom and reflection. As the game progresses, the verses narrate the life of the wandering gaucho, his confrontations with authority, his losses, and his quest for freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610780/extras/07587762eb176b4adafae4763eca03a2.webp?t=1760487025\" width=616 height=54 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game can be completed in about 1 hour. More than an extensive challenge, it is a short experience designed as a gateway to the story of <i>Mart\u00edn Fierro</i>. If it sparks your curiosity about the original work, then it has fulfilled its purpose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610780/extras/4273afe099dcf97f999e1df60920f5ce.webp?t=1760487025\" width=616 height=54 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All the verses in the game are taken directly from the original work. Although, for obvious reasons, a large part of the text has been omitted, the essence of the story remains intact. This game is not only a tribute to <i>Mart\u00edn Fierro</i> but also a way to bring its legacy to new generations through interactivity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Gran Idea Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610780/12ab33641e78184b374e0ef399ab0f37add0e294/header.jpg?t=1760487025","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3610780/557380392/a6b8c128ab6c25caf2c22690b8a9d9fc84ecb89a/1755305044/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758409388","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3610780/557380392/a6b8c128ab6c25caf2c22690b8a9d9fc84ecb89a/1755305044/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758409388","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3610780/557380392/a6b8c128ab6c25caf2c22690b8a9d9fc84ecb89a/1755305044/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758409388","id":257183960,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257183960/movie480.mp4?t=1758409388","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257183960/movie_max.mp4?t=1758409388"},"name":"Trailer 1","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257183960/2953b5e75d0604b01829ebc8f59ba5c61f3a28d9/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1758409388","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257183960/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1758409388","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257183960/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1758409388"}},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3610780/795285150/23a8440526b40f407f413b4ed2c4804fbedf95b6/1758313541/das